+Definition calldata_aggregate_reentrant_child_def:
+  calldata_aggregate_reentrant_child lo ctx fn PG site initial G0 tn0 st final root src
+      TV ts vals d xs srcword member_ptrs oid base_addr cap cutoff <=>
+  !i a mid b ep dp ei az mz.
