+     !fuel. ptr_safe_run D lo fuel ctx fn PG G tn s)` by metis_tac[] >>
+  `!D explicit. gas_origin_ptr_path (D,lo,explicit,ctx,fn,PG)
+      (s,G,tn) [] (OK t,H',u')` by
